"""ModelC Balanced Random Forest Hyperparameter Tuning Script (Colombia Dataset)

Purpose: Perform comprehensive hyperparameter tuning for a Balanced Random Forest model using
         the Colombia-specific tuning dataset (modelC_tuning_colombia.parquet)
         with strict temporal split
         (train: year <= 2014, earlystop: 2015 <= year <= 2017).

Input:   `modelC_tuning_colombia.parquet`
Output:  - brf_best_params.json (saved to training/ directory for use by modelC_BRF)

Features:
- Expanded hyperparameter search space for better optimization
- RandomizedSearchCV with Balanced Random Forest classifier
- Comprehensive parameter ranges covering common best practices
"""

